  "html": "\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\u003chtml lang=\"en\"\u003e\u003chead\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"\u003e\n\u003ctitle\u003eDelivery preferences\u003c/title\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; background: #f5f6f8; color: #1b2330; font: 16px/1.5 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; }\n  main { max-width: 560px; margin: 48px auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dde1e7; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 24px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 8px; }\n  p { color: #838383; margin: 0 0 24px; }\n  label { display: block; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  select { width: 100%; height: 44px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid #7d8696; border-radius: 8px; background: #ffffff; color: #1b2330; font: inherit; }\n  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; margin-top: 24px; }\n  button { height: 44px; padding: 0 16px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #1f5bd1; color: #ffffff; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  button.icon { width: 32px; height: 32px; padding: 0; background: #eaeef3; color: #1b2330; }\n  button:focus, select:focus { outline: none; }\n\u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n\u003cmain\u003e\n  \u003ch1\u003eDelivery preferences\u003c/h1\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eChoose when we deliver your orders. If nobody is home, we keep the parcel at the depot for five days.\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003clabel for=\"window\"\u003eDelivery window\u003c/label\u003e\n  \u003cselect id=\"window\"\u003e\n    \u003coption\u003eWeekdays, 9:00 to 17:00\u003c/option\u003e\n    \u003coption\u003eWeekday evenings, 17:00 to 21:00\u003c/option\u003e\n    \u003coption\u003eSaturdays, 9:00 to 13:00\u003c/option\u003e\n  \u003c/select\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"actions\"\u003e\n    \u003cbutton type=\"button\"\u003eSave preferences\u003c/button\u003e\n    \u003cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"icon\" aria-label=\"Help with delivery windows\"\u003e?\u003c/button\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/main\u003e\n\n\n\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e",
  "aria": "- main:\n  - heading \"Delivery preferences\" [level=1]\n  - paragraph: Choose when we deliver your orders. If nobody is home, we keep the parcel at the depot for five days.\n  - text: Delivery window\n  - combobox \"Delivery window\":\n    - option \"Weekdays, 9:00 to 17:00\" [selected]\n    - option \"Weekday evenings, 17:00 to 21:00\"\n    - option \"Saturdays, 9:00 to 13:00\"\n  - button \"Save preferences\"\n  - button \"Help with delivery windows\": \"?\"",
